OL,3,GNEWSA'Arrogant' SpaceXAI fails to
OL,4,Aattend MP's testimony
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Suffolk MP has been giving evidence
OL,7,Fto New York City Council as it becomes
OL,8,Fthe first American body to put forward
OL,9,Flaws to regulate AI developers.
OL,11,FJess Asato is suing xAI in the UK after
OL,12,Fsexualised images of her were created
OL,13,Fby its AI chatbot tool, Grok.
OL,15,FShe is seeking damages from the
OL,16,Fcompany, owned by Elon Musk, for the
OL,17,Fmisuse of her private information and
OL,18,Fbreaches of data protection rules.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
