OL,3,GNEWSA'Arrogant' SpaceXAI fails to
OL,4,Aattend MP's testimony
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsato told the BBC that the failure of
OL,7,FSpaceXAI - which owns xAI - to turn up
OL,8,Fat the hearing, despite being
OL,9,Fsubpoenaed, demonstrated its "level of
OL,10,Farrogance". SpaceXAI has been contacted
OL,11,Ffor comment.
